    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Kaal Yoddha</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Kaal Yoddha is an action-adventure game where you play as Prince Avyaan, a brave warrior and skilled archer on a cursed island plagued by evil demons. Uncover secrets of ancient masks, master bow-and-arrow combat, and face epic combat in a dark mythic kingdom of ancient power and fierce warriors.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An action-adventure game rooted in the mythic heritage of ancient India. Play as Prince Avyaan\u2014a skilled archer and brave warrior\u2014summoned to a cursed island filled with evil demons and dark forces that threaten the legacy of a lost kingdom.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>A Looming Curse</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore eerie forests, decaying temples, and hidden caverns where reality blurs into mystery. Uncover secrets of ancient relics, swords, and legends tied to a forgotten past.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Face monsters, devils, and dark powers that challenge your survival in this single-player story-driven experience.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3320200/extras/c49ce90effd4466bf1f7a1cc55e66132.poster.avif?t=1749469402\" width=616 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3320200/extras/c49ce90effd4466bf1f7a1cc55e66132.webm?t=1749469402\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Prince Avyaan\u2019s Path</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Brave the unknown and confront spreading corruption consuming everything in its path.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Descend into dark depths to battle demonic forces and reclaim your lost honor with sword and bow.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3320200/extras/9d9d6330c57dc508c8972050644981b4.poster.avif?t=1749469402\" width=616 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3320200/extras/9d9d6330c57dc508c8972050644981b4.webm?t=1749469402\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Key Features</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dynamic Combat: </strong>Engage in dynamic combat as a fierce fighter. Use your bow and arrow or sword to strike enemies from near and far. Adapt your fighting style to survive relentless attacks.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3320200/extras/f0d29fdcf6c20688141dd3325853f9ae.poster.avif?t=1749469402\" width=616 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3320200/extras/f0d29fdcf6c20688141dd3325853f9ae.webm?t=1749469402\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Mystery Unveiled: </strong>Unravel the mystery of the island through environmental storytelling, ancient murals, and cryptic notes.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Parkour &amp; Exploration: </strong>Scale cliffs and navigate treacherous terrain with parkour skills, solving puzzles to progress deeper.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Epic Battles: </strong>Test your skills against towering monsters and deadly demons standing as a testament to the curse\u2019s power.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3320200/extras/fbd4e5228ea7814e541ac2c95091dcaa.poster.avif?t=1749469402\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3320200/extras/fbd4e5228ea7814e541ac2c95091dcaa.webp?t=1749469402\" class=\"bb_img\" width=616 height=250 /></picture></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Will you survive the dark trials and uphold the legacy of your people? Take up your bow, sword, and courage to write your own legend in this thrilling action-adventure game.</strong></p>",
